00:37:24.640 --> 00:37:27.080
I loved shooting that scene so much.
我太喜欢拍那场戏了。

990
00:37:27.380 --> 00:37:27.440
Same.
我也是。

991
00:37:27.580 --> 00:37:28.600
It was so funny.
太好笑了。

992
00:37:28.800 --> 00:37:30.780
And the way Jim is messing with him.
还有吉姆捉弄他的样子。

993
00:37:30.920 --> 00:37:31.320
I know.
我知道。

994
00:37:31.460 --> 00:37:32.620
Jim is messing with him.
吉姆在捉弄他。

995
00:37:33.040 --> 00:37:36.080
Angela legitimately doesn't know any, like, celebrities.
安吉拉是真的一个明星都不认识。

996
00:37:36.740 --> 00:37:37.360
All right.
好吧。

997
00:37:37.440 --> 00:37:39.580
Well, I've got a fan story from Jennifer O.
那么，我这有一位来自俄亥俄州克利夫兰的詹妮弗·O.发来的粉丝故事。

998
00:37:39.740 --> 00:37:40.540
in Cleveland, Ohio.
詹妮弗，哦，你的故事。

999
00:37:41.380 --> 00:37:43.800
Jennifer, oh, your story.
这非常独特。

1000
00:37:44.580 --> 00:37:46.100
This is very unique.
这非常独特。

1001
00:37:46.660 --> 00:37:47.760
Jennifer says,
珍妮弗说，

1002
00:37:47.960 --> 00:37:50.460
It was my first dinner with my new boyfriend.
那是我和新男友的第一次晚餐。

1003
00:37:50.460 --> 00:37:53.460
My husband and now husband and his parents.
我现在的丈夫和他的父母。

1004
00:37:53.640 --> 00:37:58.960
And I wanted to make a good impression because I was a senior and he was a junior in high school.
我想留下一个好印象，因为我是高三学生，而他是高二学生。

1005
00:37:59.180 --> 00:38:03.900
I offered to help his mom set the table and she told me to pour drinks for everyone.
我主动提出帮他妈妈摆餐桌，她让我给每个人倒饮料。

1006
00:38:03.900 --> 00:38:06.500
So I took everyone's order, including hers.
所以我记下了每个人的要求，包括她。

1007
00:38:07.080 --> 00:38:08.300
Her order was water.
她要的是水。

1008
00:38:08.740 --> 00:38:09.580
Jennifer said,
珍妮弗说，

1009
00:38:09.580 --> 00:38:15.120
I poured all the drinks and then poured her a large glass of water from a pitcher in the refrigerator.
我倒好了所有的饮料，然后从冰箱里的一个扎壶里给她倒了一大杯水。

1010
00:38:15.420 --> 00:38:16.800
We sat down to dinner.
我们坐下来吃晚饭。

1011
00:38:16.980 --> 00:38:17.740
Everyone's chatting.
大家都在聊天。

1012
00:38:17.840 --> 00:38:18.440
It's going great.
一切都很顺利。

1013
00:38:18.600 --> 00:38:25.460
His mom takes a big swig of water and starts gagging and falls out of her chair onto the floor, grabbing her throat.
他妈妈喝了一大口水，开始作呕，从椅子上摔到地上，抓着自己的喉咙。

1014
00:38:25.460 --> 00:38:26.640
No, yes.
天哪，是的。

1015
00:38:27.040 --> 00:38:29.200
Jennifer said we thought she was choking.
珍妮弗说我们以为她在噎着。

1016
00:38:29.360 --> 00:38:35.420
So I grabbed her glass of water and she smashed it out of my hand and said,
所以我抓起她那杯水，她一把把杯子从我手里打碎，说道，

1017
00:38:35.660 --> 00:38:36.040
Vinegar!
醋！

1018
00:38:37.360 --> 00:38:42.100
Because I guess someone should have mentioned that that wasn't a pitcher of water.
因为我想应该有人提过那不是一扎水。

1019
00:38:43.280 --> 00:38:48.960
Earlier in the day, the vinegar lid broke and she poured it into a pitcher and then I served it to her.
那天早些时候，醋瓶盖坏了，她把醋倒进了一个扎壶里，然后我就把它端给了她。

1020
00:38:49.400 --> 00:38:56.800
Jennifer said luckily she survived, married her son four years later, and we're still together after 30 years.
珍妮弗说幸运的是她活了下来，四年后嫁给了她的儿子，而且三十年后的今天我们还在一起。

1021
00:38:57.440 --> 00:39:00.340
She said her mother-in-law has since passed away.
她说她的婆婆后来已经去世了。

1022
00:39:00.580 --> 00:39:01.400
She said,
她说过，

1023
00:39:01.560 --> 00:39:05.040
And I will never live down the moment I tried to kill my mother-in-law.
我永远也摆脱不了当年试图谋杀我婆婆的阴影。

1024
00:39:05.040 --> 00:39:09.760
I guess this is their family lore of how Jennifer joined the family.
我想这就是他们家族里关于珍妮弗是如何加入这个家庭的传说。

1025
00:39:11.060 --> 00:39:17.780
This is in no way that similar except that I have a pitcher, you know, just it's like a tall pitcher.
这和那个完全不同，只是我有一个扎壶，你知道的，就是一个高高的扎壶。

1026
00:39:18.000 --> 00:39:29.760
It's got like a floral theme on it and I keep it to the right of the kitchen sink because our kids always like they fix themselves a glass of water and they have like four or five sips and then they're done.
上面有花卉图案，我把它放在厨房水槽的右边，因为我们的孩子们总是自己倒一杯水，喝上四五口就不喝了。

1027
00:39:29.880 --> 00:39:33.320
And I'm just going around the house and I'm just collecting cups of water throughout the day.
然后我就会在屋里转悠，把一天下来各处剩下的半杯水收集起来。

1028
00:39:33.900 --> 00:39:38.740
And so I've told them, if you're not going to finish your water, put it in the pitcher and I'll give it to my plants.
所以我告诉过他们，如果不喝完水，就倒进扎壶里，我会拿去浇花。

1029
00:39:38.940 --> 00:39:39.420
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

1030
00:39:39.600 --> 00:39:39.760
Yeah.
是的。

1031
00:39:40.000 --> 00:39:43.880
So everyone in my family knows any unused water goes in the pitcher.
所以我们家每个人都知道，任何没喝完的水都要倒进扎壶里。

1032
00:39:44.160 --> 00:39:44.440
Oh.
哦。

1033
00:39:44.820 --> 00:39:47.480
Have you had guests drink from the water?
你有客人喝过那里的水吗？

1034
00:39:47.660 --> 00:39:48.220
I had a gueSt.
我有一个客人。

1035
00:39:48.720 --> 00:39:49.240
I had a friend.
我有一个朋友。

1036
00:39:49.240 --> 00:39:49.860
Was it me?
是我吗？

1037
00:39:50.080 --> 00:39:51.620
No, it wasn't you.
不，不是你。

1038
00:39:52.280 --> 00:39:53.440
It wasn't you.
不是你。

1039
