And he goes, no.
他说，没有。

1043
00:40:06.960 --> 00:40:08.900
And I said, did they go to the fridge to get the water?
我说，他们去冰箱倒水了吗？

1044
00:40:09.040 --> 00:40:09.600
He goes, no.
他说，没有。

1045
00:40:10.040 --> 00:40:12.260
And then we saw the pitcher had been moved.
然后我们发现扎壶被移动过了。

1046
00:40:12.540 --> 00:40:13.620
Did you say anything?
你什么也没说吗？

1047
00:40:13.960 --> 00:40:15.420
But they had already drank the water.
但他们已经把水喝了。

1048
00:40:15.960 --> 00:40:17.040
So you said nothing.
所以你什么也没说。

1049
00:40:17.200 --> 00:40:17.660
I said nothing.
我什么也没说。

1050
00:40:17.800 --> 00:40:18.700
Of course you said nothing.
你当然什么也没说。

1051
00:40:18.700 --> 00:40:19.400
I said nothing.
我什么都没说。

1052
00:40:19.620 --> 00:40:21.060
But now I'm paranoid.
但现在我被害妄想症发作了。

1053
00:40:21.060 --> 00:40:24.620
So as soon as anyone comes in the kitchen, I say to them, do not drink from that pitcher.
所以只要有人进厨房，我就对他们说，千万别喝那个壶里的水。

1054
00:40:24.620 --> 00:40:29.040
That is like everyone's backwash old water for my plants.
那里面是我收集的各种漱口水旧水，准备浇花用的。

1055
00:40:29.520 --> 00:40:33.220
I pour our unused water into our dog's bowl.
我会把没喝完的水倒进狗碗里。

1056
00:40:33.400 --> 00:40:33.820
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

1057
00:40:33.860 --> 00:40:34.720
