它会碎掉的。

1075
00:41:10.000 --> 00:41:10.960
One of the kids is going to like.
家里某个小孩会把它弄坏。

1076
00:41:11.120 --> 00:41:12.360
No, you're making a good point.
不，你说的很有道理。

1077
00:41:12.440 --> 00:41:12.580
Okay.
好吧。

1078
00:41:12.840 --> 00:41:13.160
All right.
行吧。

1079
00:41:13.820 --> 00:41:18.040
Well, no dinner party horror story episode would be complete, you guys,
那么，各位，没有哪期晚宴恐怖故事是完整的，

