We left and we never saw them again.
我们离开后就再也没见过他们。

1096
00:42:04.040 --> 00:42:05.420
They got a divorce.
他们离婚了。

1097
00:42:05.980 --> 00:42:06.580
Shocker.
真是意料之中。

1098
00:42:07.200 --> 00:42:13.540
Um, that is like literally Jan and Michael's fight.
嗯，这简直就是简和迈克尔的吵架翻版。

1099
00:42:13.720 --> 00:42:14.000
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

1100
00:42:14.140 --> 00:42:15.740
I mean, for real.
我是说，真的。

1101
00:42:15.940 --> 00:42:16.500
For real.
真的。

1102
00:42:16.940 --> 00:42:20.840
Jan and Michael have many big fights in the dinner party.
简和迈克尔在晚宴上有很多激烈的争吵。

1103
00:42:21.020 --> 00:42:28.000
But I think my personal favorite is when Michael goes out and gets the neon
但我觉得我个人最喜欢的是迈克尔出去拿了那个霓虹

1104
