00:43:22.840 --> 00:43:27.020
All you do is you get me to try to work on my rich friends.
你唯一的目的就是让我去试着拉拢我有钱的朋友们。

1131
00:43:27.300 --> 00:43:29.280
For an investment opportunity.
为了一个投资机会。

1132
00:43:29.280 --> 00:43:31.820
Man, I would love to burn your candles.
天哪，我真想把你的蜡烛烧了。

1133
00:43:32.140 --> 00:43:32.960
You burn it.
点燃它。

1134
